{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get down on Olinda streets in carnival and beat everyone on your way!\u00a0 <strong>Olinda Fighters\u00ae\u00a0</strong>is a brawl style fighting game like you've never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/06b8a30b1d7ecb22301f2d440bdf5510.poster.avif?t=1759435378\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/06b8a30b1d7ecb22301f2d440bdf5510.webm?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/06b8a30b1d7ecb22301f2d440bdf5510.mp4?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three different play modes:\u00a0 single player championship, two players versus mode, or online multiplayer up to 4 players! It is a block-party of fight!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/053ccb52fa937bd8c627ec1dc063bcc4.poster.avif?t=1759435378\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/053ccb52fa937bd8c627ec1dc063bcc4.webm?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/053ccb52fa937bd8c627ec1dc063bcc4.mp4?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the traditional giant puppets that dances across the street parades during carnival, the game relies on an simple spinning move to that mimics that dance at the same time that projects the punches towards your opponent, and a &quot;deflate&quot; dynamic that allows the player to evade the opponents attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/34a5993ecad2f19b9e4b3c9c5810786d.poster.avif?t=1759435378\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/34a5993ecad2f19b9e4b3c9c5810786d.webm?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/34a5993ecad2f19b9e4b3c9c5810786d.mp4?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can use the power-ups to hit harder your opponents and energy drinks to move faster among the people on the parade. The first to win two-out-of-three rounds is the winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/435cdd7124ab4338634cbb92b95d7c40.poster.avif?t=1759435378\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/435cdd7124ab4338634cbb92b95d7c40.webm?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/435cdd7124ab4338634cbb92b95d7c40.mp4?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite Pernambuco's carnival character, put your big-head on and come on beat some Olinda puppets! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/cf2ea8bb33329c4a6147a5e1b04dd05c.poster.avif?t=1759435378\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/cf2ea8bb33329c4a6147a5e1b04dd05c.webm?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/cf2ea8bb33329c4a6147a5e1b04dd05c.mp4?t=1759435378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618600?t=1759435378","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/0095a09cb3735cac3390a293c7770f29ab3f84b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759435378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/9df8f53d6c5eb01ab985831ab0bf7b63f35068e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759435378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/9df8f53d6c5eb01ab985831ab0bf7b63f35068e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759435378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get down on Olinda streets in carnival and beat everyone on your way!\u00a0 <strong>Olinda Fighters\u00ae\u00a0</strong>is a brawl style fighting game like you've never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618600/extras/06b8a30b1d7ecb22301f2d440bdf5510.post